<p class=MsoNormal>      &lt;section class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>        &lt;h2&gt;Editor’s note&lt;/h2&gt;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>        &lt;p&gt;The main editorial issue is that the brief
leans slightly bullish because the public facts available today are themselves
heavily bullish. The strongest neutral version should explicitly note that the
setup is powerful, but the burden of proof has shifted to the June 24 earnings
call.&lt;/p&gt;</p>

